          "settings": {
            "title": "What is N scale?",
            "answer": "<p>N scale is even smaller than OO and HO. It represents 1 foot in real life by 9 millimeters in the model (1:160 scale). This makes it a good  choice for people with limited space, but the smaller size can also mean less detail on the trains.</p>"
          }
        },
