            "title": "What is TT scale?",
            "answer": "<p>TT scale falls between HO and N scale. It represents 1 foot in real life by 12 millimeters in the model (1:120 scale). It's less common than the other scales mentioned, but it offers a good balance between size and detail.</p>"
